Description: Solves Boolean satisfiability (SAT) problems using 'CaDiCaL',
    a modern conflict-driven clause learning solver. Supports incremental
    solving, solving under assumptions, and inspection of which assumptions
    caused unsatisfiability. The 'CaDiCaL' C++ sources are bundled, so no
    external solver installation is required.
